# dist/ is checked in so `npx github:uddhav/creative-thinking` works without a
# build step, but it is entirely generated from src/. Marking it generated keeps
# it collapsed in GitHub diffs and out of language stats, so reviewers see the
# ~30% of a technique PR that is actually authored rather than the ~70% that is
# compiler output.
dist/** linguist-generated=true
dist/** -diff
